WEBVTT

00:00:02.540 --> 00:00:04.600
Let’s rehash our mission.

00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:09.980
This is the first step toward the Doctor’s dream
and our most important plan.

00:00:10.680 --> 00:00:14.400
Out of the twelve Numbers,
eleven participated in the operation.

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:17.850
Additionally, Knight Zest and
the summoner Lutecia both participated.

00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:24.080
The objective of our work is
the neutralization of the Bureau’s Surface HQ,

00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:27.040
as well as Riot Force 6, with minimal human casualties.

00:00:27.040 --> 00:00:30.440
The recovery of the Vessel of the Holy King is top priority.

00:00:30.440 --> 00:00:33.160
If the possibility arises, any Type-0 should be captured.

00:00:34.340 --> 00:00:40.040
The commander responsible for
mission control is me, the first Number, Uno.

00:02:42.880 --> 00:02:47.210
Zest, was it? Tell me just what you’re planning and what you’re after.

00:02:47.210 --> 00:02:51.310
If it’s something reasonable,
the Bureau will listen to your request.

00:02:51.310 --> 00:02:53.270
You’re young.

00:03:01.140 --> 00:03:02.690
But you’re a good knight.

00:03:02.690 --> 00:03:05.180
Now isn’t the time to be praising her, sir!

00:03:06.530 --> 00:03:08.100
Rein, have you noticed?

00:03:08.700 --> 00:03:09.150
Yes.

00:03:09.900 --> 00:03:14.910
The timing in their Unison attack is off, although only slightly.

00:03:14.910 --> 00:03:17.860
Their Unison compatibility doesn’t seem to be very good.

00:03:19.290 --> 00:03:20.760
Damn them.

00:03:20.760 --> 00:03:25.960
Their Unison compatibility seems to be good, and they’re highly skilled. They keep coming at us together.

00:03:25.960 --> 00:03:28.800
Agito, let’s cancel out of Unison.

00:03:28.800 --> 00:03:31.620
I’ll take her out in one hit with my Full Drive.

00:03:31.620 --> 00:03:36.020
You’re kidding, right?!
If you use your Full Drive, sir, your body will...

00:03:36.020 --> 00:03:37.760
I won’t go down.

00:03:37.760 --> 00:03:40.730
Not until we finish what we must do.

00:03:40.730 --> 00:03:46.410
Don’t even <i>joke</i> about that!
I told you I would protect you, sir!

00:03:46.410 --> 00:03:52.610
I won’t let her chip away at your life, sir!
I’ll open a path for you, sir!

00:03:52.610 --> 00:03:55.360
Flame on!

00:03:56.790 --> 00:03:58.710
<b>Raging Fire Sword</b>

00:04:06.880 --> 00:04:07.970
He keeps moving!

00:04:07.970 --> 00:04:11.540
Wendi, you piece of junk, get him already.

00:04:20.360 --> 00:04:21.820
An illusion?

00:04:28.400 --> 00:04:29.580
No way!

00:04:41.410 --> 00:04:44.360
More energy needed for silhouette control.

00:04:45.870 --> 00:04:48.240
Approaching energy boost limit.

00:04:49.760 --> 00:04:51.930
Just a little bit longer.

00:04:51.930 --> 00:04:54.720
Try your best until we can escape.

00:04:54.720 --> 00:04:55.710
Yes, sir.

00:04:55.710 --> 00:04:58.050
Since she can fool <i>my</i> eyes,

00:04:58.050 --> 00:05:02.150
does this illusionist know about the combat cyborg system?

00:05:03.780 --> 00:05:08.860
It doesn’t matter if they’re illusions or something else.
I’ll just smash them all!

00:05:14.000 --> 00:05:15.200
Nove!

00:05:17.320 --> 00:05:18.420
Form III

00:05:18.440 --> 00:05:19.770
Storm Form

00:05:19.770 --> 00:05:21.160
<b>Thunder...</b>

00:05:22.580 --> 00:05:23.570
<b>...Rage</b>

00:05:32.010 --> 00:05:33.870
Let’s go!

00:05:37.880 --> 00:05:40.310
Damn those assholes!

00:05:44.240 --> 00:05:49.160
Nove, Wendi. You two, help me out a bit over here.

00:05:49.160 --> 00:05:53.580
There’s another Type-0.
I’m in combat with the first produced.

00:06:01.210 --> 00:06:02.840
Captain Takamachi!

00:06:04.760 --> 00:06:06.710
Sister Schach.

00:06:06.710 --> 00:06:09.700
Sister, weren’t you in the conference room?

00:06:09.700 --> 00:06:13.880
Along with some men, we managed to open the door,

00:06:13.880 --> 00:06:16.600
and then I hurried after you two.

00:06:16.600 --> 00:06:18.560
What about Hayate and her group?

00:06:18.560 --> 00:06:22.480
The three of them are still in
the conference room along with the representatives.

00:06:22.480 --> 00:06:25.940
They’re explaining about the Gadgets and the attackers.

00:06:30.560 --> 00:06:31.820
Nice timing.

00:06:34.740 --> 00:06:36.450
Sorry to make you wait.

00:06:36.450 --> 00:06:37.620
Here you go.

00:06:38.610 --> 00:06:40.080
Thanks, everyone.

00:06:42.040 --> 00:06:44.620
I’ll go deliver these.

00:06:44.620 --> 00:06:45.460
Please do.

00:06:45.460 --> 00:06:46.710
I will

00:06:46.710 --> 00:06:48.130
Ginny?

00:06:48.130 --> 00:06:49.380
Ginny!

00:06:49.380 --> 00:06:50.460
Subaru?

00:06:50.460 --> 00:06:53.080
Transmissions aren’t getting through to Ginny.

00:06:53.080 --> 00:06:58.810
We engaged in combat with two of the combat cyborgs.
There should be more in the front.

00:06:58.810 --> 00:07:02.270
Could Ginny be in combat with them?

00:07:02.270 --> 00:07:05.720
Long Arch, this is Lightning 1.

00:07:05.720 --> 00:07:08.310
Lightning 1, this is Long Arch.

00:07:08.310 --> 00:07:11.250
Griffith? What’s wrong? You’re breaking up...

00:07:11.250 --> 00:07:14.650
We’re currently taking fire from Gadgets and unknowns.

00:07:14.650 --> 00:07:16.740
We’re holding out, but...

00:07:18.650 --> 00:07:20.000
Let’s split up.

00:07:20.000 --> 00:07:24.250
Stars will confirm Ginga’s well-being
and take down any attack force.

00:07:24.250 --> 00:07:26.080
Lightning will return to Riot Force 6.

00:07:26.080 --> 00:07:26.920
Yes, ma’am!

00:07:26.920 --> 00:07:30.870
Sister Schach, I’ll leave everyone above to you.

00:07:30.870 --> 00:07:32.860
I’ll risk my life for it.

00:07:34.090 --> 00:07:35.830
Hurry!

00:07:56.240 --> 00:07:58.950
You two have done well just by yourselves.

00:07:59.780 --> 00:08:02.370
But it’s all over now.

00:08:02.370 --> 00:08:08.360
Before my I.S., Ray Storm, there is no point in resisting.

00:08:10.540 --> 00:08:12.420
Klarwind, protect against it!

00:08:12.420 --> 00:08:13.080
Yes.

00:08:16.970 --> 00:08:18.450
Deed.

00:08:19.840 --> 00:08:22.330
I.S.: Twin Blades

00:08:38.610 --> 00:08:40.390
Goodbye.

00:08:45.960 --> 00:08:47.280
Shamal.

00:08:47.280 --> 00:08:49.000
Zafira.

00:09:23.780 --> 00:09:25.400
Okay, you can still shoot.

00:09:25.400 --> 00:09:27.560
Your skills haven’t atrophied yet.

00:09:38.840 --> 00:09:39.740
Sonic Move

00:09:53.610 --> 00:09:56.070
Combat cyborgs.

00:09:56.070 --> 00:09:58.900
Erio, Caro, go ahead of me.

00:09:58.900 --> 00:10:00.320
But Fate!

00:10:00.320 --> 00:10:01.440
I’ll catch up to you soon.

00:10:01.440 --> 00:10:01.990
Go!

00:10:02.690 --> 00:10:03.720
Fried.

00:10:06.410 --> 00:10:08.240
Erio.

00:10:08.240 --> 00:10:15.620
They’re opponents who can outrange us in air combat.
If we stay, Fate can’t fight to her fullest.

00:10:15.620 --> 00:10:16.040
Okay.

00:10:18.590 --> 00:10:21.540
Bardiche, third form!

00:10:21.540 --> 00:10:23.830
Zanber Form

00:10:42.520 --> 00:10:45.150
Several S+ ranks have begun to move.

00:10:45.150 --> 00:10:47.640
Have their defenses already recovered enough?

00:10:47.640 --> 00:10:49.560
Oh goddammit!

00:10:49.560 --> 00:10:52.960
Vita, Signum is heading this way!

00:10:55.380 --> 00:10:56.950
Is this it?

00:10:56.950 --> 00:10:58.650
Let’s retreat.

00:10:59.300 --> 00:11:01.880
God damn...

00:11:01.880 --> 00:11:04.910
At least... at least let me take them down!

00:11:08.180 --> 00:11:09.790
Vita, above you!

00:11:12.650 --> 00:11:15.090
I’ll smash you down right here!

00:11:17.520 --> 00:11:19.220
Limiter release.

00:11:34.590 --> 00:11:36.650
Agito, we’re retreating.

00:11:43.440 --> 00:11:45.220
J-Jackass...

00:11:46.210 --> 00:11:47.430
Rein!

00:11:47.430 --> 00:11:49.370
Hey, Rein!

00:11:59.100 --> 00:12:00.530
That’s...

00:12:04.530 --> 00:12:05.260
Signum.

00:12:06.780 --> 00:12:08.100
Rein is...

00:12:08.100 --> 00:12:09.910
..and Eisen!

00:12:21.550 --> 00:12:24.340
Subaru, you’re getting too far ahead of us.

00:12:24.340 --> 00:12:26.630
Sorry, but I’m fine.

00:12:26.630 --> 00:12:28.130
She can’t help it.

00:12:28.130 --> 00:12:31.000
In a place like this, Subaru is faster than us.

00:12:31.000 --> 00:12:33.840
It’s okay if we just hurry.

00:12:33.840 --> 00:12:34.620
Yes, ma’am.

00:12:35.150 --> 00:12:38.640
Ginny.

00:12:39.980 --> 00:12:41.550
Ginny!

00:13:35.900 --> 00:13:37.330
Give her back.

00:13:40.030 --> 00:13:43.070
Give Ginny back!

00:13:52.710 --> 00:13:55.050
Get out of my way!

00:14:05.030 --> 00:14:09.480
Nove, Wendi, let your sister stop her.
Retreat from here.

00:14:09.480 --> 00:14:10.510
Roger.

00:14:10.510 --> 00:14:12.430
Dammit.

00:14:12.430 --> 00:14:15.830
Is her I.S. a contact weapon?

00:14:15.830 --> 00:14:18.310
<b>I.S.: Aerial Rave</b>

00:14:18.310 --> 00:14:19.500
Let’s go, Nove.

00:14:19.500 --> 00:14:21.910
But Cinques will be left alone.

00:14:21.910 --> 00:14:23.420
Do not worry about it, Nove.

00:14:24.630 --> 00:14:27.300
Your sister can fight without any contact.

00:14:34.750 --> 00:14:39.620
Don’t get in my way!

00:14:39.620 --> 00:14:44.590
Sein! Sein! Hurry up and give Cinques a hand!

00:14:44.890 --> 00:14:48.550
I understand, I’ll head over there right now. Leave it to your sister!

00:15:00.870 --> 00:15:02.110
Ginny!

00:15:02.790 --> 00:15:05.250
You won’t get by...

00:15:06.660 --> 00:15:08.120
Protection

00:15:23.340 --> 00:15:24.750
Give her back.

00:15:30.360 --> 00:15:34.350
Give Ginny back!

00:15:38.530 --> 00:15:40.160
Here comes Sein!

00:15:40.160 --> 00:15:41.580
I’m saved...

00:15:49.460 --> 00:15:55.530
The main body was damaged to the end. The system rests.

00:16:02.970 --> 00:16:03.770
Subaru!

00:16:11.730 --> 00:16:13.980
The system is completely down.

00:16:13.980 --> 00:16:16.360
The defense system is already...

00:16:59.520 --> 00:17:01.310
You’re in the way.

00:17:10.280 --> 00:17:12.630
There’s no mistake that this is the girl.

00:17:12.630 --> 00:17:14.590
Agreed, that’s correct.

00:17:14.590 --> 00:17:17.510
Thank you for saving her.

00:17:17.510 --> 00:17:20.970
She looks to be in bad shape, too.

00:17:20.970 --> 00:17:23.180
You must be tired.

00:17:23.180 --> 00:17:25.050
We’ll come and pick you up

00:17:25.050 --> 00:17:26.000
I’m okay.

00:17:26.000 --> 00:17:29.920
I’ll just fly on a Type 2 until I get
to a safer place to teleport out.

00:17:37.730 --> 00:17:39.490
This is too much.

00:17:40.580 --> 00:17:43.040
That’s...?

00:17:43.940 --> 00:17:44.710
That girl.

00:17:44.710 --> 00:17:46.620
It’s Vivio!

00:17:48.080 --> 00:17:50.280
Papa! Mama!

00:17:50.280 --> 00:17:51.280
Stop it!

00:17:51.280 --> 00:17:52.500
Stop it please!

00:17:52.500 --> 00:17:55.960
Just what right do you guys have?

00:17:55.960 --> 00:17:58.720
That should be our line.

00:17:58.720 --> 00:18:05.660
The son of the Mondial family, Erio, has already died from illness.

00:18:05.660 --> 00:18:10.980
And this kid is a special clone of your late son.

00:18:10.980 --> 00:18:16.950
A degraded copy, born by using the terrible life fabrication technology of Project F.

00:18:23.190 --> 00:18:24.190
No!

00:18:24.190 --> 00:18:25.240
Papa!

00:18:25.240 --> 00:18:27.160
Mama, save me!

00:18:27.160 --> 00:18:30.150
No!

00:18:31.160 --> 00:18:33.580
Strada, Form Zwei!

00:18:33.580 --> 00:18:35.480
Jet Form

00:18:37.370 --> 00:18:38.830
Erio?

00:18:38.830 --> 00:18:40.320
Caro, please back me up.

00:18:40.960 --> 00:18:42.200
Erio!

00:18:42.840 --> 00:18:44.620
Explosion

00:18:44.620 --> 00:18:45.970
Booster...

00:18:45.970 --> 00:18:46.640
...start!

00:18:59.070 --> 00:19:02.050
Get out of my way!

00:19:10.620 --> 00:19:11.850
Excuse me.

00:19:14.500 --> 00:19:16.110
Erio!

00:19:23.880 --> 00:19:26.840
Was that one of the remaining F kids?

00:19:26.840 --> 00:19:29.440
Well, I imagine he’s not dead.

00:19:30.720 --> 00:19:34.890
We’ll leave the final bits to the Gadgets.

00:19:36.570 --> 00:19:39.510
Let’s go, Galue.

00:19:44.360 --> 00:19:48.330
Where is Scaglietti?
Why would he cause something like this?

00:19:48.330 --> 00:19:52.240
If you want, we’ll guide you to him anytime.

00:19:52.240 --> 00:19:56.760
Of course, that is if you comply with us.

00:19:56.760 --> 00:19:58.200
He’s a criminal.

00:19:58.200 --> 00:19:59.690
And the worst kind, at that!

00:19:59.690 --> 00:20:02.620
Please don’t say such unfortunate things.

00:20:02.620 --> 00:20:07.220
The Doctor effectively fathered you and that boy, among others.

00:20:08.970 --> 00:20:13.930
You guys have life because the Doctor established the framework for Project F.

00:20:13.930 --> 00:20:14.900
Shut up!

00:20:14.900 --> 00:20:16.880
I guess there’s no helping it.

00:20:19.280 --> 00:20:22.730
I believe we’ll meet again.

00:20:22.730 --> 00:20:25.210
And, at that time, we’ll talk in detail.

00:20:25.210 --> 00:20:29.470
Oh, and you may have realized already, but...

00:20:31.880 --> 00:20:36.020
Next time, you will no longer be able to defeat us.

00:20:46.300 --> 00:20:54.770
In five minutes, the fleet of Gadgets in the sky and other aerial forces will start a mission to destroy the facility.

00:20:55.770 --> 00:21:01.150
Their goal is to destroy the facility,
and they will not hinder anyone attempting to flee.

00:21:02.310 --> 00:21:06.110
Please withdraw calmly and without resistance.

00:21:06.990 --> 00:21:09.950
Why did you do this?

00:21:19.830 --> 00:21:22.710
<b>Summoning Dragon Mount</b>

00:21:29.750 --> 00:21:31.920
<b>Voltaire</b>

00:21:50.520 --> 00:21:52.480
Don’t destroy....

00:21:54.440 --> 00:22:00.040
Don’t destroy our home!

00:22:06.250 --> 00:22:12.000
Bureau operatives on Midchilda’s surface, did you like it?

00:22:12.000 --> 00:22:15.480
While it’s somewhat small, this was my present to you.

00:22:15.480 --> 00:22:21.400
They were oppressed under the flag of “maintaining order” and “keeping the Lost Logia from causing harm.”

00:22:21.400 --> 00:22:28.880
I hope you’ll consider this present
a gift from all the brilliant engineers

00:22:28.880 --> 00:22:33.890
who brought about great advances in legitimate technology.

00:22:35.030 --> 00:22:39.980
But I am also one who loves humanity and life.

00:22:39.980 --> 00:22:46.670
I tried hard not to shed any blood in vain
and to act as bloodlessly and humanely as possible.

00:22:47.750 --> 00:22:55.220
Technology can completely conquer the enemy, whom you should hate. Do you think I’ve done enough to show that?

00:22:55.220 --> 00:22:57.930
I’ll leave it at this today.

00:22:57.930 --> 00:23:04.440
If you have a need for this wonderful power and technology,
feel free to contact me anytime with a request.

00:23:04.440 --> 00:23:07.420
I’ll hand it over to you under special circumstances.

00:23:11.900 --> 00:23:15.240
We couldn’t stop the prophecy.

00:23:15.240 --> 00:23:17.200
Not yet.

00:23:21.080 --> 00:23:27.000
Riot Force 6 isn’t—we aren’t—through yet.

00:25:17.490 --> 00:25:20.400
Surface HQ and Riot Force 6
are in tatters.

00:25:20.400 --> 00:25:23.710
But we cannot just stand defeated.

00:25:23.710 --> 00:25:26.540
We will start back up once again, with everyone.

00:25:33.430 --> 00:25:34.960
Take off!
